 atch live via the City of Toronto's YouTube Channel at youtube.com/Toront
 oCityCouncilLive http://youtube.com/TorontoCityCouncilLive\n\nSubmit Writ
 ten Comments: Email clerk@toronto.ca mailto:clerk@toronto.ca . Clearly re
 ference the agenda item number and title in your submission. Note: public
  deputations are heard at Committees\, not directly at City Council\, unl
 ess required by law.\n\nView Agendas & Minutes: toronto.ca/council http:/
